operty-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" href=\"?note=d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fea02b696529d019\" href=\"?note=fea02b696529d019\" title=\"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability\">67-df-bounded-axiomatizability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Lemma 5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"57"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"68"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"来源陈述和双向证明已读；下述有效构造与每个证明义务已人工重建，未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 一致且递归可枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_g(X)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_g(X)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(S\\cup X,S)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(S\\cup X,S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteOver}\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteOver}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fea02b696529d019\" href=\"?note=fea02b696529d019\" title=\"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability\">67-df-bounded-axiomatizability</a>。</li>\n<li>固定自然有效句法编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，连接与句子识别可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_g\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_g\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1,\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1,\\mathrm{RecPred}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IA}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IA}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" href=\"?note=d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-axiomatization</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigwedge\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a> 的有限列递归，空列的值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_{L_A}\">\\(\\top_{L_A}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\\)</span> 在下式构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigwedge\\vec\\varphi:m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\vec\\varphi\\in X^m\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigwedge\\vec\\varphi:m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\vec\\varphi\\in X^m\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IA}_S(S\\cup X)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\\\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nf(g(\\chi))=g(\\theta)\\land\n(S\\cup X\\vdash\\theta)\\land\n\\bigl(S\\nvdash(\\chi\\to\\theta)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IA}_S(S\\cup X)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\\\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nf(g(\\chi))=g(\\theta)\\land\n(S\\cup X\\vdash\\theta)\\land\n\\bigl(S\\nvdash(\\chi\\to\\theta)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 Lemma 4.5。代码上全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 只需在合法有限合取上返回句子代码；其他输入可统一返回0。本条把原书的 PR 基理论假设放宽到 r.e.，因为以下证明只使用对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的有效证明搜索。</p>\n<p>充分性：有效枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(\\varphi_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(X=(\\varphi_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_m=\\bigwedge_{i\\le m}\\varphi_i\">\\(\\chi_m=\\bigwedge_{i\\le m}\\varphi_i\\)</span>，并从某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\nvdash\\varphi_i\">\\(S\\nvdash\\varphi_i\\)</span> 起重新排序；其存在性来自非有限性。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_0=\\varphi_0\">\\(\\psi_0=\\varphi_0\\)</span>。已得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+X\\vdash\\psi_n\">\\(S+X\\vdash\\psi_n\\)</span> 时，有效搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge n\">\\(m\\ge n\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+\\chi_m\">\\(S+\\chi_m\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_n\">\\(\\psi_n\\)</span> 的证明，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_{n+1}=\\chi_m\\land g^{-1}(f(g(\\chi_m)))\">\\(\\psi_{n+1}=\\chi_m\\land g^{-1}(f(g(\\chi_m)))\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+X\\vdash\\psi_{n+1}\">\\(S+X\\vdash\\psi_{n+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\psi_{n+1}\\to\\psi_n\">\\(S\\vdash\\psi_{n+1}\\to\\psi_n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\nvdash\\psi_n\\to\\psi_{n+1}\">\\(S\\nvdash\\psi_n\\to\\psi_{n+1}\\)</span>；否则经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+\\chi_m\\vdash\\psi_n\">\\(S+\\chi_m\\vdash\\psi_n\\)</span> 会得被禁止的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_m\\to f(\\chi_m)\">\\(\\chi_m\\to f(\\chi_m)\\)</span>。各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_n\">\\(\\chi_n\\)</span> 都被后续 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 推出，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+X\">\\(S+X\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+\\{\\psi_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(S+\\{\\psi_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 演绎等价。</p>\n<p>再令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_0=\\psi_0\">\\(\\theta_0=\\psi_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{n+1}=\\psi_n\\to\\psi_{n+1}\">\\(\\theta_{n+1}=\\psi_n\\to\\psi_{n+1}\\)</span>。有限归纳恢复全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi_n\">\\(\\psi_n\\)</span>，故它们仍公理化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+X\">\\(S+X\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+\\neg\\theta_n\">\\(S+\\neg\\theta_n\\)</span> 一致，且由链的递减蕴涵，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+\\neg\\theta_n\">\\(S+\\neg\\theta_n\\)</span> 推出全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_k\">\\(\\theta_k\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ne n\">\\(k\\ne n\\)</span>）；因此其余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_k\">\\(\\theta_k\\)</span> 不能推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_n\">\\(\\theta_n\\)</span>。这个新公理集是有效序列的值域，故r.e.，满足 i.a.。</p>\n<p>必要性：令 r.e. 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 为不可冗余公理化。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\">\\(\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\\)</span>，有效搜索一个有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_0\\subseteq Y\">\\(Y_0\\subseteq Y\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+Y_0\\vdash\\chi\">\\(S+Y_0\\vdash\\chi\\)</span>。非有限性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 无限，因此能有效枚举出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in Y\\setminus Y_0\">\\(\\theta\\in Y\\setminus Y_0\\)</span>。置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(g(\\chi))=g(\\theta)\">\\(f(g(\\chi))=g(\\theta)\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\chi\\to\\theta\">\\(S\\vdash\\chi\\to\\theta\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+Y_0\\vdash\\theta\">\\(S+Y_0\\vdash\\theta\\)</span>，与不可冗余性矛盾。合法合取代码是递归集，故非法输入统一置0给出所需全递归扩展。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability","status":"resolved","id":"fea02b696529d019","a