hor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IA}_S$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]。$\\bigwedge$ 取 [[67-df-formula]] 的有限列递归，空列的值为 $\\top_{L_A}$。$\\mathrm{Conj}(X)$ 在下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IA}_S$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]。$\\bigwedge$ 取 [[67-df-formula]] 的有限列递归，空列的值为 $\\top_{L_A}$。$\\mathrm{Conj}(X)$ 在下式构造。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_g(X)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(S\\cup X,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteOver}","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_1,\\mathrm{RecPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IA}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conj}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigwedge\\vec\\varphi:m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\vec\\varphi\\in X^m\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IA}_S(S\\cup X)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Conj}(X)\\\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\quad\nf(g(\\chi))=g(\\theta)\\land\n(S\\cup X\\vdash\\theta)\\land\n\\bigl(S\\nvdash(\\chi\\to\\theta)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"X=(\\varphi_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_m=\\bigwedge_{i\\le m}\\varphi_i","display":false},{"tex":"S\\nvdash\\varphi_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_0=\\varphi_0","display":false},{"tex":"S+X\\vdash\\psi_n","display":false},{"tex":"m\\ge n","display":false},{"tex":"S+\\chi_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_{n+1}=\\chi_m\\land g^{-1}(f(g(\\chi_m)))","display":false},{"tex":"S+X\\vdash\\psi_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\psi_{n+1}\\to\\psi_n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\nvdash\\psi_n\\to\\psi_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"S+\\chi_m\\vdash\\psi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_m\\to f(\\chi_m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"S+X","display":false},{"tex":"S+\\{\\psi_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_0=\\psi_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_{n+1}=\\psi_n\\to\\psi_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi_n","display":false},{"tex":"S+X","display":false},{"tex":"S+\\neg\\theta_n","display":false},{"tex":"S+\\neg\\theta_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ne n","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_n","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Conj}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"Y_0\\subseteq Y","display":false},{"tex":"S+Y_0\\vdash\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in Y\\setminus Y_0","display":false},{"tex":"f(g(\\chi))=g(\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\chi\\to\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"S+Y_0\\vdash\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":4086,"backlinks":[{"id":"fbcaa556e59d96b1","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"源证明对每个 $T$ 公理的有限合取 $\\chi$，有效取 $Q+\\chi$ 的 Gödel 固定点 $G_\\chi$（[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]、[[67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]）。一致性给出 $Q+\\chi\\nvdash G_\\chi$，故逻辑不能证明 $\\chi\\to G_\\chi$。原书 Theorem2.4 的内部推导给 $\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\vdash G_\\chi$；Corollary1.8 的本质反身性又给 $T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}$，因此 $T\\vdash G_\\chi$。将 $\\chi\\mapsto G_\\chi$ 代入 [[67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion]] 得结果；若理论有限，则可合取后删除冗余，直接有结论。"},{"id":"57d3217ac67bc5a6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion]]"}],"outgoing":["2035a1f4d72e7df9","d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","fea02b696529d019","e5654af7c954e1c0","ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","5f966a5415552b4e"]}